# Dependabot's `github-actions` updater matches `uses:` declarations with an LF-only pattern, so a CRLF
# workflow file makes an otherwise valid bump fail with `No files changed!`. These files are only ever read by
# Linux runners and by Dependabot, so pinning them to LF costs nothing on a Windows checkout.
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf
.github/workflows/*.yaml text eol=lf
